        "answer": "Yes, that's correct.  In addition to Digimon from the hand or battle area, you may also place cards from the trash as digivolution cards for a DigiXros.",
        "question": "Does \"When you would play this card, you can also place cards from your trash in digivolution cards for a DigiXros\" mean that you can place cards from your hand, batle area and trash as digivolution cards for a DigiXros?",
